  - m_Id: 3882586464318
    m_Key: "And there she goes, Rory\u2019s little restaurant gets more crowded day
      by day."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464319
    m_Key: One night, Rory is counting her profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464320
    m_Key: 50 thousand dollars and more! I have earned more than enough to pay off
      my Student Loan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464321
    m_Key: Thanks to you, now she has enough money to pay her debts!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464322
    m_Key: But what goal will she pursue next? What does Rory dream of now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464323
    m_Key: Own a Grand restaurant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464324
    m_Key: Maybe start a living in French.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464325
    m_Key: Or pursue higher culinary education.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464326
    m_Key: Anyway now she already owns a very successful restaurant, let's help her
      grow it even bigger!
