  - m_Id: 3882586464338
    m_Key: One early morning, our sweet Rory is checking up on her mails..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464339
    m_Key: She just received her Chef Certificate after graduating from Culinary
      School.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464340
    m_Key: But wait, what is that small note attached below?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464341
    m_Key: Ow, Rory has a huge debt from her Student Loan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464342
    m_Key: "And what\u2019s this? A new restaurant just started out its business..
      near Rory\u2019s place!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464343
    m_Key: Seems like Rory has got an idea to solve her financial problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464344
    m_Key: HMM...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3882586464345
    m_Key: "I\u2019ll open a mini restaurant to pay off my debts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
